# Product messaging canon

For product descriptions, publications, video scripts, landing pages, social posts, help content, presentations, and partner materials, use `docs/PRODUCT_MESSAGING_CANON.md` as the source of truth.

- Preserve its product logic, terminology, and human Ukrainian tone.
- You may shorten or adapt the text to a format, but do not contradict or overstate it.
- Keep Stage Builder + Matches as one path from stage idea to ready match.
- Describe PractiScore as a ready file/export, never as two-way synchronization.
- If shipped behavior changes, update the canon in the same task before publishing new claims.
